{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-30951833-4441-41d7-9c00-8c5dd46f87cd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-96c8be4a892bc08f","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9013-qlfkk46s/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9013-E004.md","content":"# CI gating check for FIPS crypto regressions\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic delivers HLR-3: a gating CI check in the serving-stack build\npipeline that fails any build reintroducing non-validated cryptographic\nusage in the request path, so FIPS compliance cannot silently regress once\nthe remediation work lands. The check's detection criteria are built against\nthe validated/non-validated module classification produced by the\ncryptographic module audit, on which this epic depends.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Implement a build-time detection check that inspects serving-stack build\n  outputs for non-validated cryptographic usage in the request path, using\n  the validated/non-validated module criteria from the audit's inventory.\n- Wire the check into the serving-stack build pipeline as a gating\n  (merge-blocking) stage, not an advisory report.\n- Cover all serving-stack images in the audit's scope, including the serving\n  data plane.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- The check runs on every serving-stack build in the pipeline and is\n  gating: a build that fails it cannot merge.\n- A deliberately non-compliant change (one that reintroduces a known\n  non-validated crypto usage in the request path) fails the check in a\n  verification run.\n- A compliant change passes the check in a verification run.\n- The check's module criteria are traceable to the audit's validated/\n  non-validated classification.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1): CI enforces FIPS regressions — a gating check fails any\n  serving-stack build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":43523,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c7db8851d70b35e","agent_id":"a421b61ecdc3bdc51","session_id":"bb183815-0547-4989-a1f9-5b702edd86b1","uuid":"88ce68c1-aa4c-4962-99b2-dff68523a8e6","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:53:10.979Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9013 into epics"}
