{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a77688453880c078","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9013-E004\n3\ttitle: CI gating check for FIPS crypto regressions\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9013\n5\tcomponent: KServe\n6\tteam: RHOAI Serving\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9013-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9013-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: The check's detection criteria are rewritten to match the audit's\n15\t    final validated/non-validated module classification; if the audit changes which\n16\t    images are in scope, the check's coverage is rewritten accordingly.\n17\tai_signals:\n18\t  change_specificity: 1\n19\t  pattern_precedent: 0\n20\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n21\t  existing_foundation: 1\n22\t  open_questions: 0\n23\t  external_dependency: 1\n24\t  human_process_gates: 1\n25\t  repo_access: 1\n26\t  architecture_claims: 1\n27\timplementation_type: null\n28\tinvestigation_signals: null\n29\tai_implementability: High\n30\tai_implementability_score: 6\n31\tjira_key: null\n32\tbranch: null\n33\t---\n34\t# CI gating check for FIPS crypto regressions\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tThis epic delivers HLR-3: a gating CI check in the serving-stack build\n39\tpipeline that fails any build reintroducing non-validated cryptographic\n40\tusage in the request path, so FIPS compliance cannot silently regress once\n41\tthe remediation work lands. The check's detection criteria are built against\n42\tthe validated/non-validated module classification produced by the\n43\tcryptographic module audit, on which this epic depends.\n44\t\n45\t## Scope\n46\t\n47\t- Implement a build-time detection check that inspects serving-stack build\n48\t  outputs for non-validated cryptographic usage in the request path, using\n49\t  the validated/non-validated module criteria from the audit's inventory.\n50\t- Wire the check into the serving-stack build pipeline as a gating\n51\t  (merge-blocking) stage, not an advisory report.\n52\t- Cover all serving-stack images in the audit's scope, including the serving\n53\t  data plane.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- The check runs on every serving-stack build in the pipeline and is\n58\t  gating: a build that fails it cannot merge.\n59\t- A deliberately non-compliant change (one that reintroduces a known\n60\t  non-validated crypto usage in the request path) fails the check in a\n61\t  verification run.\n62\t- A compliant change passes the check in a verification run.\n63\t- The check's module criteria are traceable to the audit's validated/\n64\t  non-validated classification.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-3 (P1): CI enforces FIPS regressions — a gating check fails any\n69\t  serving-stack build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bacfe8ea362d9293","agent_id":"ac3468000e703d62b","session_id":"bb183815-0547-4989-a1f9-5b702edd86b1","uuid":"98e7426b-8d3e-4378-ae96-541b7e3f113e","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:05:39.710Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a77688453880c078","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013 after revision"}
